ian-Cycle-Program","stars":3,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"A Hamiltonian path or traceable path is a path that visits each vertex exactly once. A graph that contains a Hamiltonian path is called a traceable graph. A graph is Hamiltonian-connected if for every pair of vertices there is a Hamiltonian path between the two vertices.  A Hamiltonian cycle, Hamiltonian circuit, vertex tour or graph cycle is a cycle that visits each vertex exactly once (except for the vertex that is both the start and end, which is visited twice). A graph that contains a Hamiltonian cycle is called a Hamiltonian graph.","topics":[],"score":251781,"global_rank":58112},{"name":"sfaxon/PokerEval","owner":"sfaxon","html_url":"https://github.com/sfaxon/PokerEval","stars":4,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"C","description":"Objective C library for evaluating Texas Holdem hands","topics":[],"score":251780,"global_rank":58113},{"name":"JeremyGrosser/adafruit_metro_rp2040_bsp","owner":"JeremyGrosser","html_url":"https://github.com/JeremyGrosser/adafruit_metro_rp2040_bsp","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Ada","description":"Adafruit Metro RP2040 BSP","topics":[],"score":251779,"global_rank":58115},{"name":"analogrelay/oxygen-os","owner":"analogrelay","html_url":"https://github.com/analogrelay/oxygen-os","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Rust","description":null,"topics":[],"score":251779,"global_rank":58116},{"name":"seomoz/roger-fetch-vault-token","owner":"seomoz","html_url":"https://github.com/seomoz/roger-fetch-vault-token","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":68,"issues":1,"language":"Go","description":null,"topics":[],"score":251779,"global_rank":58118},{"name":"prosperi/AROS","owner":"prosperi","html_url":"https://github.com/prosperi/AROS","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":null,"topics":[],"score":251777,"global_rank":58120},{"name":"benthamc/test-quick-start","owner"